# Keeps `src/androidHostTest/kotlin` in version control.
#
# The source set is declared and configured — `androidHostTestRuntimeOnly` pulls the
# JUnit Vintage engine, and detekt is pointed at this path — but it holds no Kotlin
# sources yet. The Robolectric test for #227 is not written; `SyncDiGraphResolutionTest`
# is a JVM test in `jvmTest`, not a Robolectric one, and does not exercise the Android
# platform modules.
#
# Without this file the directory is absent from a fresh clone, detekt silently ignores
# a path it cannot read, and `DetektSourceSetsAreAllScannedTest` fails — which is the
# failure this file exists to make honest. Delete it together with the first real test.